/**
 * Policy Clause Templates — Data Protection (p37-p41)
 * p37: Data Protection, p38: Data Classification, p39: Data Retention,
 * p40: Data Archiving, p41: Encryption
 * Based on ISO 27001:2022, BSI IT-Grundschutz, NIST CSF 2.0, NIS2 Art.21, DSGVO
 *
 * Scope delegation:
 *   p37 — GDPR/data protection (principles, rights, DPO, DPIA, breach)
 *   p38 — Data classification (levels, labelling, handling, DLP)
 *   p39 — Data retention & deletion (schedules, secure deletion, legal hold)
 *   p40 — Data archiving (long-term storage, format migration, audit-proof)
 *   p41 — Encryption (algorithms, key management, PKI, transport/at-rest)
 *
 * Cross-reference rules:
 *   - Data breach notification (DSGVO 72h) → p37-c09; crisis notification → p34-c17
 *   - Backup retention → p39-c06 (data governance); backup lifecycle → p36-c08 (technical)
 *   - Classification-based DLP → p38-c06 (unified auto-classification + DLP)
 */
